<title>FRANCE: French housing starts fall in 3-mos to end Nov 96.</title>
<headline>French housing starts fall in 3-mos to end Nov 96.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French housing ministry gave the following unadjusted figures on housing starts.</p>
<p>			     3-mos to end     12-mos to end</p>
<p>				   Nov 1996     Nov 1996</p>
<p>HOUSING APPROVED</p>
<p> (total nos)		  78,100	  303,800</p>
<p> (y/y pct chg)		  4.0		-5.2</p>
<p> STARTED			68,300	  273,600</p>
<p> (percent)			-3.3	     -6.3</p>
<p>NON-HOUSE BUILDING</p>
<p>APPROVED</p>
<p> (sq metres)		 8.45 million	33.05 million</p>
<p> (y/y pct chg)		  -5.3	     -6.4</p>
<p> STARTED		     7.85 million	30.84 million</p>
<p> percent			  -9.7	     -1.5</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
